{"kind":"raw","payload":{"plan":{"grant_id":"urn:stdo-skills:T001:final-status-publication:1:write","intended_base64":"","intended_sha256":"3cf08462ae0e1ae6d9da3ddcffad0c305668fb53e6397c94caa3deecf4c77ee5","interpretation":null,"mode":"replace","path":"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/specification/GOALS.md","record":{"provenance":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"TASK.md","root":"publication","selector":null,"sha256":"6d3390321f90f06668bbea9c6f83ea679d9ae3a593ffb139f5dc6812734414fc"},"text":"# Goals\n\n## Current selection\n\n[T-001](../.ai-workspace/tickets/active/T-001-skills-dogfood.md) constructs the\nindependent STDO Skills Product with shared requirements and separately tuned\nCodex/Claude tenants. Its static governing methodology is the published immutable\nSTDO 3.0.1 RC1 release; the Product Definition's manifest pin is unchanged.\n\nThe common WHAT was selected for bounded construction. Both tenant packages and\nthe native a_c 3.0.1 support increment are implemented. Actual host trials and\nindependent readbacks provide finite evidence for discovery, small work, source\nbinding, failure handling, recovery and selected release/installation paths.\nThe [delivery report](../.ai-workspace/work/T001/DELIVERY.md) and its exact case\nindex distinguish completed evidence, historical failures and remaining claims.\n\n## Remaining mandatory qualification\n\nClaude Q05 remains open: a bounded handoff and source-first candidate review must\nbe witnessed through its declared CLI/Bash/Read path. The attempted operator MCP\npath is outside the frozen tenant's transport support. Its corrected preflight\nand dispatch reached a nested Worker that failed login before tools or candidate\nwork. This is supplemental integration evidence, not qualification of the CLI\npath or proof of a general skill defect. No further authentication workaround or\nmixed-host substitution is selected.\n\nCodex's finite Q05 handoff and the repaired Claude lifecycle have independent\nreadback. Preserve operator-assisted setup, original LC-01, timeouts and the\nother stated limits. A later selected supported CLI handoff after usable child authentication, or a\nseparately designed and selected composition, must supply the missing handoff and\nindependent-assessment evidence before the delivery decision; do not reopen criteria or rerun unaffected cases for a uniform\naggregate total. The available outcome is implemented initial dogfood packages\nwith bounded evidence; full qualification and accepted delivery remain open.\n\nThe [T-001 ledger](../.ai-workspace/tickets/active/T-001-skills-dogfood.md#execution-plan-and-ledger)\nowns work disposition. Statistical reliability, comparative efficiency, owner\nacceptance, Product release and global deployment are not claimed by this finite\nconstruction exercise. Incomplete methodology representation and fresh-machine\nmanager onboarding remain separate work outside this Product's delivery.\n"},"requester":"writer","target":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"specification/GOALS.md","root":"product","selector":null,"sha256":"fcdbe69ddbddcd2a2a38d5a7cee2bdff90a7c8fd7d37439a0575e66d72c892a5"},"target_preimage":"fcdbe69ddbddcd2a2a38d5a7cee2bdff90a7c8fd7d37439a0575e66d72c892a5"},"preimage":{"bytes":1395,"exists":true,"mode":420,"sha256":"fcdbe69ddbddcd2a2a38d5a7cee2bdff90a7c8fd7d37439a0575e66d72c892a5","type":"regular"},"recheck":{"executor_dependencies":[],"method_profile":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-method-stdo-3.0.1.json","root":"tool","selector":null,"sha256":"a886047e50b8a45c3b47addea0f0809dca2a6c54ac35948df5e01893cc30bbf7"},"observations":[{"id":"sha256:0e4b58185c3b13a9eb8456ebd9a3374b585383df06fb8868efc4d0f7091da9a8","sha256":"0e4b58185c3b13a9eb8456ebd9a3374b585383df06fb8868efc4d0f7091da9a8"}],"policy_sha256":"95234ca0a5a64f3bf1725361bf830e9afa314f1befea17fbbb5a24b3a50ceb2f","prod